00:30:30.960 --> 00:30:34.240
I don't like this way of doing things, you and the amateurs.

00:30:34.500 --> 00:30:37.900
I'll kill you!

00:31:27.640 --> 00:31:29.510
Versus 63k

00:31:30.000 --> 00:31:30.880
How many blocks do you have?

00:31:31.410 --> 00:31:32.530
Twelve blocks.

00:31:33.070 --> 00:31:34.760
There's no doubt about it.

00:31:34.880 --> 00:31:36.320
No, there isn't.

00:31:36.380 --> 00:31:39.180
The number doesn't match.

00:31:39.540 --> 00:31:41.490
One block has disappeared.

00:31:41.970 --> 00:31:56.520
And the number is the same.

00:32:13.630 --> 00:32:17.000
Hm? What is this guy?

00:32:30.092 --> 00:32:30.392
Nope.

00:32:37.388 --> 00:32:39.388
You

00:33:37.770 --> 00:33:40.170
Simulation, you've inputted my movements.

00:34:03.260 --> 00:34:04.200
He took the key!

00:34:04.340 --> 00:34:20.490
You bastard!

00:34:20.810 --> 00:34:25.010
I'll give you a new pattern!

00:34:56.460 --> 00:34:57.360
Calculate it with your own hands!

00:35:37.480 --> 00:35:48.940
Versus, mission complete. Tell it to the owner of the house.

00:35:48.940 --> 00:35:51.530
The owner of the house is unknown.

00:35:52.030 --> 00:35:54.360
The name of the child is not registered.

00:35:55.340 --> 00:35:55.780
Take it.

00:36:31.820 --> 00:36:40.680
Don't mess with me. It's not like I'm the only one with less experience.

00:36:40.860 --> 00:36:47.520
I repeat, if you subtract 10 years and 6 months from the limit of the violation of orders,

00:36:47.520 --> 00:36:49.570
you will have an extension of 315 years and 2 months.

00:36:51.670 --> 00:36:54.680
Give up, Sengoku. It won't start even if you go to Versus.

00:36:55.440 --> 00:36:59.800
I agree. For the time being, Matenro is our nemesis.

00:37:00.000 --> 00:37:03.480
If you have a neck, there's a chance you'll get rid of this thing.

00:37:04.560 --> 00:37:06.050
Don't bother me.

00:37:06.570 --> 00:37:07.970
Listen, you weakling.

00:37:08.250 --> 00:37:10.170
I'll make you sell your iron to the sky.

00:37:10.750 --> 00:37:12.530
Remember me in the mountain of iron.

00:37:13.650 --> 00:37:16.000
And you'll regret it.

00:37:16.410 --> 00:37:18.790
You're a weakling without blood or tears.

00:37:19.270 --> 00:37:26.020
Tell me what to write here.

00:37:27.680 --> 00:37:29.880
Well, in short...

00:37:30.000 --> 00:37:32.960
Suspect Amachi Yoshikazu died 15 years ago, didn't he?

00:37:33.220 --> 00:37:35.020
And yet, how did he do such a thing?

00:37:35.320 --> 00:37:35.560
Listen to him!

00:37:36.500 --> 00:37:36.940
Geez!

00:37:38.440 --> 00:37:40.700
He said he didn't know about the Versus.

00:37:41.700 --> 00:37:43.340
What should we do with the report?

00:37:43.380 --> 00:37:45.950
Just write that it's impossible to analyze it.

00:37:46.790 --> 00:37:49.630
Amachi was killed long ago.

00:37:50.750 --> 00:37:53.550
His consciousness was linked to the computer,

00:37:53.650 --> 00:37:56.510
and the program of revenge against Kurokawa was activated,

00:37:56.950 --> 00:37:57.910
and he tried to destroy the whole of the Demon King.

00:38:00.000 --> 00:38:01.580
How can you explain that?

00:38:01.640 --> 00:38:04.580
There is only one thing that is certain.

00:38:04.680 --> 00:38:08.400
Kurokawa died and Amachi's revenge was finally fulfilled.

00:38:09.370 --> 00:38:11.730
I can't stop anyone from doing that.

00:38:12.010 --> 00:38:14.170
What a mystery.

00:38:16.240 --> 00:38:19.080
That's right.

00:38:19.380 --> 00:38:23.610
Let's have some tea.

00:38:24.400 --> 00:38:25.000
Stop it.

00:38:25.200 --> 00:38:27.420
Even if you drink a little tea and become an old man,

00:38:27.800 --> 00:38:29.940
If you keep your neck up, your shoulders will be stiff and your shoulders will be stiff.

00:38:30.000 --> 00:38:33.960
I'll be the one to do it then.

00:38:34.780 --> 00:38:40.010
Thank you. But before that...

00:38:45.670 --> 00:38:48.000
Before that, I'll break through this cage.

00:38:48.920 --> 00:38:50.960
I'll clean up all the evil that's been hiding in this Oedo.

00:41:03.036 --> 00:41:05.036
Thanks for watching!
